BT 1 0 0 1 0 19 Tm 14.5 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (A switch is a Layer-2 device that forwards frames selectively based on its ) Tj /F2 10 Tf (MAC address table) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( \(also called) Tj T* (the CAM table or forwarding table\). It builds the table dynamically using the following process:) Tj T* ET
